error[graph.bounded_workflow_effect_cycle]: unmeasured cycle in a bounded workflow is not allowed: workflow `BoundedUnmeasuredRing` is `@bounded`, and rule cycle to_pong -> to_ping -> to_pong turns with nothing proving it stops
